---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor User
    participant Browser as Next.js Client<br/>(Browser)
    participant Auth as Supabase Auth
    participant Dexie as Local Persistence<br/>(Dexie / IndexedDB)

    Note over User,Browser: Trigger: User opens Riskfolio
    User->>Browser: Open Riskfolio
    Browser->>Auth: Check for an existing session
    Auth-->>Browser: No authenticated session
    Note over Browser,Auth: Guest mode makes no Supabase<br/>portfolio queries or writes

    Browser->>Dexie: Open or create the Riskfolio database
    Browser->>Dexie: Read the portfolio from ?portfolio=id,<br/>or the most recently accessed portfolio
    Dexie-->>Browser: Matching portfolio or no result

    alt A local portfolio exists
        Browser->>Dexie: Update lastAccessedAt
        Dexie-->>Browser: Update acknowledged
        Browser-->>User: Display the local portfolio
    else This browser has no saved portfolios
        Browser->>Dexie: Save the default Sample Portfolio
        Dexie-->>Browser: Sample saved
        Browser->>Browser: Replace URL with ?portfolio=sample-id
        Browser-->>User: Display the Sample Portfolio
    end
